// Black Dragon Breaths
@1 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Line~
@2 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Line
(Evocation)

Level: 2
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 0
Area of Effect: 30-ft. line
Saving Throw: Special

The Black Dragon Disciple spits acid like a black dragon, a line that hits every creature in front of him, ally or enemy. Each creature in the line suffers 1d4 points of acid damage per level of the caster (4d4 at least, 8d4 at most), with no saving throw. A creature that fails a save vs. Breath suffers half the damage again the next round, as the acid keeps eating. This breath ignores magic resistance.~

// Orb
@3 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Orb~
@4 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Orb
(Evocation)

Level: 1
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 1 creature, then the enemies within 10 ft. of it
Saving Throw: Special

The Black Dragon Disciple spits his breath into his hand, shapes it into an orb and hurls it at a creature. The orb deals 2d4 points of acid damage, +1d4 at levels 3, 5 and 7 (5d4 at most), with no saving throw, then bursts into acid shards that hit every enemy within 10 ft. of the target for 1d4 less; allies and neutral creatures are spared. A creature that fails a save vs. Breath suffers half the damage again the next round, as the acid keeps eating. This breath ignores magic resistance.~

// Trap
@5 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Trap~
@6 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Trap
(Evocation)

Level: 3
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: Until triggered
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 20-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

The Black Dragon Disciple spits his breath into his hand, shapes it into an orb and throws it at a spot, where it hovers until a creature comes close. Then it explodes: every creature within 20 ft., ally or enemy, suffers 1d4 points of acid damage per level of the caster (10d4 at most), with no saving throw. A creature that fails a save vs. Breath suffers half the damage again the next round, as the acid keeps eating. This breath ignores magic resistance.~

// Ball
@7 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Ball~
@8 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Ball
(Evocation)

Level: 4
Range: 40 ft.
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 20-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

The Black Dragon Disciple spits his breath into his hands and shapes it into an orb that drifts slowly to the targeted point, then explodes: every creature within 20 ft., ally or enemy, suffers 1d4 points of acid damage per level of the caster (12d4 at most), with no saving throw. A creature that fails a save vs. Breath suffers half the damage again the next round, as the acid keeps eating. This breath ignores magic resistance.~

// Cone
@9 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Cone~
@10 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Cone
(Evocation)

Level: 5
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 30-ft. cone
Saving Throw: Special

The Black Dragon Disciple breathes his acid in a wide cone, holding still for a second. Every creature in the cone, ally or enemy, suffers 1d4 points of acid damage per level of the caster (15d4 at most), with no saving throw; the disciple is not hit by his own breath. A creature that fails a save vs. Breath suffers half the damage again the next round, as the acid keeps eating. This breath ignores magic resistance.~

// Cloud
@11 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Cloud~
@12 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Cloud
(Evocation)

Level: 6
Range: 40 ft.
Duration: 6 rounds
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: 20-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Special

The Black Dragon Disciple spits his breath into his hands and shapes it into an orb that drifts to the targeted point and bursts into a corrosive cloud lasting 6 rounds. Each round, every creature in the cloud, ally or enemy, suffers 4d4 points of acid damage; a successful save vs. Breath halves it. This breath ignores magic resistance.~

// Rain
@13 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Rain~
@14 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Rain
(Evocation)

Level: 7
Range: Visual range of the caster
Duration: 1 round/level (at least 14 rounds)
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: 15-ft. radius
Saving Throw: 1/2

The Black Dragon Disciple breathes a cloud of acid into the sky that pours down on the area. Creatures in the area when the spell is cast, ally or enemy, suffer 1d4 points of acid damage each round until the spell ends. Moving out of the area does not stop the damage: the acid adheres to the skin. Each round, a successful save vs. Breath halves the damage for that round. This breath ignores magic resistance.~

// Eruption
@15 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Eruption~
@16 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Eruption
(Evocation)

Level: 8
Range: 0
Duration: Instantaneous
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: 20-ft. radius around the caster
Saving Throw: Special

The Black Dragon Disciple spits acid all around him, holding still for a second. Every creature within 20 ft., ally or enemy, suffers 1d4 points of acid damage per level of the caster (20d4 at most), with no saving throw; the disciple is not hit by his own breath. A creature that fails a save vs. Breath suffers half the damage again the next round, as the acid keeps eating. This breath ignores magic resistance.~

// Bolt
@17 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Bolt~
@18 = ~Black Dragon Breath: Bolt
(Evocation)

Level: 9
Range: 40 ft.
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Special

The Black Dragon Disciple spits a bolt of concentrated acid, the spit of an ancient wyrm, at a single creature. The target suffers 20d4 points of acid damage, with no saving throw.

If the target fails a save vs. Breath, the acid keeps eating: it suffers 10d4 more points of acid damage the next round. Moreover, each of the following curses has a 15% chance to strike it, independently of the others:
- Poison: poisoned for 4 rounds.
- Disease: diseased (-2 Strength and Dexterity) for 4 rounds.
- Insects: harassed by a swarm of insects for 2 rounds.
- Entanglement: held by swamp plants for 2 rounds.
- Fear: panicked for 2 rounds.
- Blindness: blinded for 2 rounds.
A target that succeeds at its save only suffers the initial damage. This breath ignores magic resistance.~
